id: pm-vcs-o5e3
title: Bundle export and import so two repositories exchange history
description: "Serializing a set of commits with every object they reach plus the refs that name them into one file, and importing it into another repository. This is the minimum that makes the system a distributed VCS rather than a local one, and it is how an agent hands work to another agent or to CI."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "area:vcs"
created_at: "2026-07-30T22:37:55.527Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-30T22:55:31.198Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: Exporting a branch and importing it into an empty repository reproduces identical commit ids and identical trees; importing a bundle whose base commits are absent fails with the missing ids named rather than importing partially; re-importing a bundle already present is a no-op
